<% content_for :footer, render("digest_footer", user: @user, kind: "daily digests") -%>
<% if @test -%>
<% if @sample -%>
TEST DIGEST. Nothing is within 90 days of expiry right now, so this shows made-up sample data.
<% else -%>
TEST DIGEST. Built from today's data: every current certificate within 90 days of expiry, or already expired. Nothing was logged, so the real daily digest is unaffected.
<% end -%>

<% end -%>
<%= pluralize(@items.size, "certificate") %> <%= @items.one? ? "needs" : "need" %> attention.
Each one has reached an expiry notice (90, 60, 30 or 7 days left) or has expired.
<% if @groups.empty? -%>

Nothing needs attention today.
<% end -%>
<% @groups.each do |project, people| -%>

<%= project_heading(project) %>
<%= "=" * project_heading(project).length %>
<% if (compliance_url = project_compliance_url_or_nil(project)) -%>
Compliance matrix: <%= compliance_url %>
<% end -%>
<% people.each do |crew_member, items| -%>

<%= crew_member.display_name %><% if (member_url = crew_member_url_or_nil(crew_member)) %>: <%= member_url %><% end %>
<% items.each do |item| -%>
  - <%= item_line(item) %> [<%= threshold_label(item) %>]
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

Open CertTrack: <%= root_url %>
